### Root
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### General question
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/securelife-assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-user-1",
  "message": "What policies does SecureLife offer?",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0
}

### Personal question - starts authentication
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/securelife-assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-user-2",
  "message": "What is the status of my claim?",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0
}

### Send policy number
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/securelife-assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-user-2",
  "message": "SL-MOTOR-1001",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0
}

### Send access code
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/securelife-assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-user-2",
  "message": "1234",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0
}

### Ask another personal question in same session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/securelife-assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-user-2",
  "message": "Which add-ons are included in my policy?",
  "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
  "temperature": 0
}

### End session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/end-session?session_id=demo-user-2
